course: dictionary
lesson: 425
title: Finding meaning in context: aquarium
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Context means the words around a word. They are clues that help you work out what an unfamiliar word means, even before you check a dictionary.
explain: «In a big aquarium you can walk through a tunnel of thick clear acrylic, so the sea is all around you and sharks glide over your head.» Walking through a tunnel with the sea all around you tells you an aquarium is a place where you can see sea creatures.
explain: «Aquarium sharks are fed regular meals, and keepers record how much each one eats.» Keepers are the people who look after the animals, so an aquarium is a place where animals are cared for. Swap your meaning into the sentence to check that it still makes sense.
fact: An aquarium is a glass tank of water where fish and water plants are kept, at home or at school.
fact: An aquarium can also be a building, like a zoo for water animals, where people go to see fish, sharks and other sea creatures.
fact: The plural of aquarium can be aquariums or aquaria.
fact: Aquariums are cared for by keepers, who feed the animals, clean the tank and check the water temperature.
exercise: «In a big aquarium you can walk through a tunnel, and sharks glide over your head.» Where are the sharks? | In the school hall | Inside a pocket | Under the floor of the car park | *Above you, in the water
exercise: Who looks after the animals in an aquarium? | Tapping visitors | Tunnels | *Keepers | Sharks
exercise: What is a glass tank of water where fish are kept at home or school called? | *An aquarium | A zoo | A petrol station | A library
test: Which of these is a water animal with no backbone, from «Some of the strangest animals in the aquarium»? | *Octopus | Tiger | Sparrow | Horse
test: Why should you not tap on aquarium glass? | It makes the glass shine | *It makes a loud, frightening noise for the fish | It cleans the tank | It helps the fish sleep
exam: Which is a correct plural of aquarium? | *aquariums | aquariummen | aquariumes | aquarii
